        "value": "largest(text): scan with a balance counter; when it returns to 0 at index i, the block from start to i is '1' + text[start+1:i] + '0', so append '1' + largest(text[start+1:i]) + '0' and set start = i+1. Sort the collected blocks in reverse order and join. solve(s) returns largest(s)."
      },
